        <mxCell id="VpzSjvloVnrgPybgbCj5-840" parent="VpzSjvloVnrgPybgbCj5-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;An appointment can have zero or many ClinicalEntries, while each ClinicalEntry originates from one Appointment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;+ Whose clinical history is this?&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;ClinicalEntry → MedicalRecord → Patient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;+ Which encounter produced this information?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;ClinicalEntry → Appointment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→ Patient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;= Issue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;⚠️Worth examining carefully: Both lead to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→ Patient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;clinical Entry gives us:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;MedicalRecordID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;where the clinical entry belongs and &quot;who&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;ppointmentID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;which encounter generated it and &quot;who&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Notice the who maps back to Patient, which could return inconsistent data, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;so we need to enforce that both resolve to the same Patien&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;t... This is a constraint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;- Because EntryDate look redunctant:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;ClinicalEntry → Appointment → AppointmentDateTime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;But they&#39;re not necessarily the same fact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;EntryDate (Occurrence of entry)&amp;nbsp; !=&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;AppointmentDateTime (when app was set)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;+ So EntryDate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→ EntryDateTime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;⚠️ Revisit ISSUE: Both lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Patient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;Inside &lt;code&gt;ClinicalEntry&lt;/code&gt;, both &lt;code&gt;AppointmentID&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;MedicalRecordID&lt;/code&gt; are non-key attributes. Therefore, &lt;code&gt;MedicalRecordID&lt;/code&gt; can be determined through &lt;code&gt;AppointmentID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;To Avoid: T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;he same clinical entry could incorrectly reference an appointment and medical record belonging to different patients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;= We drop MedicalRecordID and keep only AppointmentID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;- We can find MedicalRecord as follows:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;ClinicalRecord&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→ Appointment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→ Patient&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;→&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;MedicalRecord&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="550" width="732.94" x="72.64" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VpzSjvloVnrgPybgbCj5-852" connectable="0" parent="VpzSjvloVnrgPybgbCj5-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="123.71" width="311.58" x="511.22" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
